WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.467
Jenna, here's how this works,
okay?

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:05.033
We have nine mystery boxes
containing objects

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:06.667
no one has ever seen before.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:08.334
On your turn, you pick a box,

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:10.734
take out the object,
describe it to your opponent.

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:11.801
Then they have to guess

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.734
if you're lying or telling
the truth.

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:17.300
Jenna, you pick the first box.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:22.667
[ Audience shouting numbers ]

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:23.901
-Three?

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:28.834
[ Drum roll ]

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:30.334
-You are choosing three.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.501
Huh, it looks --
it looks light.

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:38.567
-[ Groans ]
-Yeah, too late.

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:40.501
Too late to act now.
-Now?

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:43.300
-Too late to act now.
I know it's light.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.200
Are you going to lie or are you
going to tell the truth?

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.000
Very interesting. Jenna Ortega.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.133
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:53.567
[ Tapping ]

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:55.367
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Interesting.
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:57.300
Oh, oh, I see.
You're making sounds.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.634
